    "northStar": "Dark Fieldwork Atlas",
    "overview": "Near-black surfaces, white typography and sharp neutral controls bring the supplied dark reference into the existing operating platform. Host Grotesk carries Romanian interface labels, geographic records and source summaries.\n\nThin neutral borders and tonal changes organize dense information. A restrained red glow sits behind the main working surface; geographic dataset colors retain their established meanings.",
